                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Nykaa Fashion, Ajio or Myntra — which is biggest?</h3>
                                        <p>Myntra largest overall. Ajio second growing rapidly + Reliance ecosystem. Nykaa Fashion smaller but premium-focused + growing. Different segments + strategies.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new fashion marketplaces compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Very difficult against established leaders. Vertical-specific + demographic-specific + regional niching possibly viable. Direct competition challenging.</p>
                                        <h3>Which is best for fashion D2C brands to sell on?</h3>
                                        <p>All three viable depending on brand positioning. Premium brands → Nykaa Fashion + Ajio Luxe. Mass brands → Myntra + Ajio. Multi-marketplace approach optimal.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest fashion marketplace lesson?</h3>
